sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant L as Leader Broker
    participant F as Follower Broker
    participant C as Consumer

    P->>L: Produce(msg1, msg2)
    Note over L: Append to local log<br/>LEO advances
    F->>L: FetchRequest(offset=N)
    L-->>F: msg1, msg2
    Note over F: Append to local log<br/>LEO advances
    F->>L: FetchRequest(offset=N+2)
    Note over L: Update HW barrier<br/>(msg1, msg2 committed)
    L-->>P: Ack(Success)
    
    C->>L: FetchRequest(offset=N)
    Note over L: Serve up to HW
    L-->>C: msg1, msg2
